* LT3094 Negative LDO: -7 V IN  -->  -5 V OUT, light resistive load
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* Vendor macro-model
.lib LT3094.sub

* ---------------- Power source (negative rail) ------------------
VIN  IN  0  DC -7
* small ramp-free DC source; caps give the natural start-up transient

* ---------------- Input / output capacitors ---------------------
CIN   IN   0  10u
COUT  OUT  0  22u

* ---------------- Load: -5 V / 500 ohm = -10 mA -----------------
RL    OUT  0  500

* ---------------- Output programming ----------------------------
* SET pin sources 100 uA:  VOUT = -100uA * RSET = -5 V with RSET = 50k
RSET  SET  0  50k

* ---------------- Power-good pull-down (open-collector) ---------
RPG   PG   0  100k

* ---------------- Regulator -------------------------------------
* Pin order: IN OUT OUTS SET ILIM EN/UV PG PGFB GND
XU1  IN  OUT  OUT  SET  IN  0  PG  OUT  0  LT3094
* OUTS tied to OUT (remote sense at the load)
* ILIM tied to IN  -> internal (maximum) current limit
* EN/UV tied to GND -> device enabled
* PGFB tied to OUT  -> power-good monitors the output

* ---------------- Analysis --------------------------------------
.tran 0 5m 0 5u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=4m TO=5m

.options plotwinsize=0
.end
